From: Javen Xu <javen_xu@realsil.com.cn>

This patch add support for changing rx queues by ethtool. We can set rx
1, 2, 4, 8 by ethtool -L eth1 rx num.

Signed-off-by: Javen Xu <javen_xu@realsil.com.cn>
